  "passage": "10th May Today was our school science fair. I worked on my physics project about electricity. I made a poster and put an advertisement on the school noticeboard to attract visitors. My friend Tom helped me carry the heavy equipment; he's very strong, like a hotel porter! The judges were impressed. One of them, a famous scientist from the city university, asked me lots of questions. I was nervous but I explained my report clearly. Afterwards, I felt hungry. I went to the café and had a yogurt with some spinach – not my favourite, but it's healthy! It started raining heavily at lunchtime. I was so glad I remembered my umbrella. I walked home slowly, thinking about my project. I hope I win a prize. It would be great for my university account.",
